WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.591
Three items measure 3, 8 and 5 units. Which is longest? Let us think carefully. Put

00:00:05.591 --> 00:00:09.971
the measurements in order: [3, 5, 8]. The answer is 8. Great work!

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:16.103
Three items measure 4, 9 and 6 units. Which is shortest? Let us think carefully. Put

00:00:16.103 --> 00:00:20.426
the measurements in order: [4, 6, 9]. The answer is 4. Great work!

00:00:21.283 --> 00:00:26.874
Three items measure 5, 10 and 7 units. Which is middle? Let us think carefully. Put

00:00:26.874 --> 00:00:31.417
the measurements in order: [5, 7, 10]. The answer is 7. Great work!

00:00:32.283 --> 00:00:38.074
Three items measure 6, 11 and 5 units. Which is longest? Let us think carefully. Put

00:00:38.074 --> 00:00:42.779
the measurements in order: [5, 6, 11]. The answer is 11. Great work!
